    nut recess shoulder     4.85 mm
  GONE with the split: a 7.6 mm bay crown 25.4 mm down a hole that opened only at the bed, two 12.4 mm tab-slot bridges, a 3.6 mm keyway bridge, and four J4 socket roof facets at 60 deg.
